#
# Sailjail permission for the Reef licence hand-off, installed by the Reef
# client package as /etc/sailjail/permissions/ShipwrightLicences.permission.
# A paid Shipwright app lists `ShipwrightLicences` in its desktop file's
# [X-Sailjail] Permissions= to ask Reef for its licence token
# (GetLicence on org.shipwright.Reef.Licences1, see
# reef/licence/src/handoff.rs) instead of the user pasting it.
#
# Only talking to the service's own bus name is allowed. The service is
# D-Bus activated (shipwright-reef-licenced) and exits when idle.

# x-sailjail-description = Shipwright licences
# x-sailjail-long-description = Read this app's licence from the Reef store

dbus-user.talk org.shipwright.Reef.Licences
